{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver","id":92994,"title":"Sidereal Taxi Driver","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-17T15:10:46-07:00","id":92994,"title":"Sidereal Taxi Driver","content":"So when the current campaign arc I am playing in ends we may start a Modern Shard game. Reading the drive charms I went with my gut and have decided to play a Sidereal Taxi Driver. Journeys seems like the logical caste, but I think there is merit playing a Secrets (who knows all the hidden shortcuts and destinations of the city), or a Endings (because what\u2019s more important to a taxi driver than getting their fare to their final destination).<br /> <br /> I\u2019m envisioning my Character having a radio tuned into dispatch in Yu-Shan, frequenting a diner across from union station full of a usual crowd of \u201cAcquaintances\u201d, and living in the penthouse above the diner (to get to Yu-Shan in our creation you will have to take the elevator to the top floor in very particular buildings, my apartment will be half way between creation and Yu-Shan, I can catch a dragon taxi off the fire escape.)<br /> <br /> What I\u2019m really looking for are any charms or resplendent destiny ideas that you think could compliment this concept in a unique way. I plan on playing a more passive character, focusing on being more of a transporter, lore-master, and even oracle for the party.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T16:01:29-07:00","id":93028,"title":"","content":"Celestial Circle Sorcery + Whirlwind of Fate + Yellow Path<br /> <br /> You will never be late. Or any of your guests.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/239565-wizard-s-panoply-how-to-play-a-mage-in-exalted-collection-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Complete the Wizard's Panoply</a></b> [How to be a mage in Creation]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/442-nephtys","name":"Nephtys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar442_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T16:12:53-07:00","id":93038,"title":"","content":"Chosen of Secrets seems like a good choice. There's a good reason cab drivers are informants in cop shows so often. They can see and hear some pretty crazy stuff, depending on where they work.<br /> <br /> A friend of mine knew a cab driver in New York who used to share stock tips based on phone calls he'd overheard driving businessmen around, who retired before 40. Unless a cab driver has a particularly &quot;exotic&quot; scent, or is the type who fancies himself a tour guide or philosopher, it's easy to forget they're there. Even if their passengers keep quiet, they can pick up a lot of info just by watching what sort of people want to go from Point A to Point B.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T16:19:42-07:00","id":93046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93038#post93038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chosen of Secrets seems like a good choice. There's a good reason cab drivers are informants in cop shows so often. They can see and hear some pretty crazy stuff, depending on where they work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly, I was kind of thinking that Journeys was almost too obvious a choice. I can kind of see taxi drivers being like the wise men of the city, they understand the ebb and flow of the traffic, and see all levels of society in their travels. I think I\u2019ll go with Secrets.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T16:32:31-07:00","id":93062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>turkeygiant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93046#post93046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Exactly, I was kind of thinking that Journeys was almost too obvious a choice. I can kind of see taxi drivers being like the wise men of the city, they understand the ebb and flow of the traffic, and see all levels of society in their travels. I think I\u2019ll go with Secrets.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a good point. Greensids are about disclosing secrets at the appropriate time just as much as accumulating secrets in the first place. Cab driver is a great job for the professional Mysterious Wise Old Man who shows up just long enough to help you think through some serious crap, then sends you on your way. A high Manipulation would be a must, for asking the sort of leading questions that will enable you to be Captain Exposition without arousing suspicion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T18:16:45-07:00","id":93102,"title":"","content":"Well, sometimes the taxicab just won't cut it. For those times, have Sail (+2 Rotary-Wing Aircraft). And a helicopter. :P<br /> <br /> Also, you have Survival in-caste, so make use of the landscape rearrangement charm to make a racetrack, or provide a handy ramp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2438-satori","name":"Satori","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T18:31:21-07:00","id":93110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satori</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93102#post93102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, you have Survival in-caste, so make use of the landscape rearrangement charm to make a racetrack, or provide a handy ramp.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh God, it's like Crazy Taxi...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T19:08:13-07:00","id":93133,"title":"","content":"Go Battles, a veteran of the wars on the fringe of the world who Exalted after returning home and had taken up a job as a taxi driver to make ends meet. That way, when you use Predestined Escort Coincidence to scoop the Solar into your cab and he tells you to &quot;follow that car!,&quot; you can start shooting at the other car with all the Revolver Ocelot and magic bullet tricks in Sidereal Firearms while using Inscrutable Eloquent Glance to track the other car and Celestial Drifter Panoply to keep your glove compartment packed with firearms, ammunition, and explosives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T20:25:59-07:00","id":93173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93133#post93133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Go Battles, a veteran of the wars on the fringe of the world who Exalted after returning home and had taken up a job as a taxi driver to make ends meet. That way, when you use Predestined Escort Coincidence to scoop the Solar into your cab and he tells you to &quot;follow that car!,&quot; you can start shooting at the other car with all the Revolver Ocelot and magic bullet tricks in Sidereal Firearms while using Inscrutable Eloquent Glance to track the other car and Celestial Drifter Panoply to keep your glove compartment packed with firearms, ammunition, and explosives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that is certainly a option. I was planning on playing a more behind the scenes sort of character for a change, but I should keep yellow battle-wagon of doom in mind as a possibility too lol! If i remember correctly you wrote the Sidereal charms in Shards, so the advise should carry some weight!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","user":"turkeygiant","date":". 03-17-2014, 11:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T20:37:50-07:00","id":93182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93133#post93133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Go Battles, a veteran of the wars on the fringe of the world who Exalted after returning home and had taken up a job as a taxi driver to make ends meet. That way, when you use Predestined Escort Coincidence to scoop the Solar into your cab and he tells you to &quot;follow that car!,&quot; you can start shooting at the other car with all the Revolver Ocelot and magic bullet tricks in Sidereal Firearms while using Inscrutable Eloquent Glance to track the other car and Celestial Drifter Panoply to keep your glove compartment packed with firearms, ammunition, and explosives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Korben Dallas?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T20:40:10-07:00","id":93187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nocte ex Mortis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93182#post93182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Korben Dallas?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh God....<br /> <br /> My biggest problem with going to the forums for advise is someone says something so awesome and turns the concept I was originally going with on its head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T20:40:59-07:00","id":93191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nocte ex Mortis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93182#post93182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Korben Dallas?</div> </div> </div> </div>Infinite document = multi-pass?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T20:58:15-07:00","id":93209,"title":"","content":"The Taxi Driver in Vampire: the Masquerade Bloodlines is Caine, maybe you will meet him IC to resolve once and for all who will win when &quot;Exalted vs Caine&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 03-18-2014, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T04:01:16-07:00","id":93365,"title":"","content":"I am not always for taking the obvious choice, but in this case I would definitely go with Journeys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T09:52:02-07:00","id":93543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://samandfuzzy.com/archive.php?comicID=402\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.samandfuzzy.com/img/comics/003846.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://samandfuzzy.com/archive.php?comicID=402\" target=\"_blank\"> Skull Panda Backed My Kickstarter </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://samandfuzzy.com/archive.php?comicID=402\" target=\"_blank\"> http://samandfuzzy.com/archive.php?comicID=402 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Suddenly it all makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1397-parallel","name":"Parallel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T12:03:51-07:00","id":93658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/92994-sidereal-taxi-driver?p=93365#post93365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am not always for taking the obvious choice, but in this case I would definitely go with Journeys.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get that having Drive be such a big part of the character would make sense for Journeys, but the more I think about it the more I feel like Secrets will help to cultivate a sense of mystery around my character. For my character it will be less about getting the person to the place they want to go, than it will be about interacting with them on the trip and doling out sage advice along the way.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}